  "SubGoals": [],
  "Description": "The RenderModuleTypeForGoal is designed to render a module type based on a specified goal. It first checks if the path of the goal to call is not empty. If it is not empty, it attempts to read a file from the specified application path and the goal's path, writing the content to a variable. If the file is not found (error 404), it calls another goal to handle the not found case. Next, it renders a specific template and writes the output to a render variable. Finally, it appends the rendered content to a module variable.",
  "Visibility": 0,
  "GoalFileName": "CodePanel.goal",
